Subject: [PATCH] test: expose frozen cloud skill fixture failures

Install the response expectation after fixture setup and make submission errors visible before wiremock verifies expectations during teardown.
---
 .../suite/scenarios_frozen_cloud_skills.rs    | 56 ++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

diff --git a/codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_frozen_cloud_skills.rs b/codex-rs/core/tests/suite/scenarios_frozen_cloud_skills.rs
index 25d094c..68cd41e 100644
